[Music]  the scp foundation specializes in  tracking anomalous creatures entities or  objects and protecting mankind by  keeping these anomalies contained it  doesn't happen very often though that an  scp surrenders itself to the foundation  offering to be contained without putting  up a fight you might think that that  would be a welcome change for the  foundation's personnel getting an easy  containment like that rather than having  to devote valuable time resources and  even lives to capturing an anomaly but  then you have to ask the obvious and  worrying questions how did this anomaly  know where to find the foundation so  that it could turn itself in in the  first place did somebody send it and if  so why well don't worry you don't need  to try and imagine this scenario because  an scp turning itself over to the  foundation under mysterious  circumstances has actually already  happened one day security personnel at  an scp foundation containment site  opened the front door to find an scp  just sitting there on the doorstep the  anomaly was brought in for questioning  and while it was soon designated scp-032  it has sometimes been known by another  name brother's bride scp-032 is a person  or rather a replica of a person not a  living statue that moves whenever you  look away or a wax work that comes to  life when the sun goes down no this  replica is far stranger  scp-032 resembles a human woman around  30 years of age who made her who she is  supposed to resemble and just where  exactly she came from are all still  questions the foundation have been  unable to answer but what the research  teams have been able to determine is  what she is made from brother's bride  consists largely of plastics at least  the external portion of her body her  skin is made from a combination of 5.5  millimeter thick silicone and other  plastic fiber polymers all colored with  a pigment to more closely mimic the  shade of caucasian human skin  scp-032 has been referred to as a type f  human simulacrum by the foundation  meaning that she has an imperfect  outward resemblance to a human being and  the internal workings of her body are  drastically different from an ordinary  human's organs or central nervous system  what does scp-032 have instead while she  lacks any skeleton or any of the other  internal parts that make up a human body  instead her insides are entirely refined  liquid oil however in spite of having no  bones no organs and existing as just  pure oil filling up a plastic skin  scp-032 has no problem moving on her own  or communicating verbally when she was  first discovered waiting outside the  foundation's slovakian compound brothers  bride claimed that she had come there to  be stored  scp-032 is imperfect in how closely she  resembles a human being and this becomes  more apparent the closer one gets to her  at a distance she can maintain some  illusion of appearing to be fully human  however her appearance becomes less and  less convincing as someone approaches  naturally the sight of an uncanny  rubbery almost human is enough to  unsettle someone perhaps even cause  discomfort but this also happens to be  unrelated to scp-032's anomalous  abilities which she detailed to  foundation personnel when she was first  contained the foundation security team  that discovered scp-032  patiently sitting and waiting to be  found questioned her motives and how she  had come to be there there was no record  of what time she might have arrived on  the compound security cameras and  scp-032 gave the personnel no inkling as  to how she knew the location of the  foundation's slovakian site somehow  she'd managed to approach without being  spotted by anyone but would not explain  how she had done so security personnel  at the site were obviously skeptical and  asked brothers bride why she had come to  the foundation  scp-032 claimed that her creators had  commanded her to that she was to be  placed in indefinite storage until  claimed although the silicon-based woman  appears to possess a normal level of  cognitive function she claims that she  is not fully sapient meaning scp-032  does not possess the intelligence or  understanding of other human beings at  least according to her by her own  admission  scp-032 is an intermediary acting on  behalf of her creators although the scp  foundation has yet to be able to verify  this as for her anomalous abilities  scp-032 was kind enough to detail these  to the security personnel that first  found her she has an innate ability to  influence any biological entity in her  immediate vicinity in other words any  organism that gets too close well not  quite any there is a limitation to her  power  scp-032 can only affect a creature or  organism not created by related to or  influenced by humanity so plants animals  even microorganisms like bacteria all  fall into the category of things that  scp-032 has an effect on according to  the various tests the foundations  researchers have conducted the exact  nature of how scp-032's abilities work  seems to vary but her presence always  causes massive and irreversible damage  to an animal or organism's ability to  exchange or use energy for example when  scp-032 is surrounded by wild flora  these plants will lose the ability to  conduct the process of photosynthesis  they therefore can no longer produce or  consume energy preventing them from  continued growth and ultimately causing  death in much the same vein any animals  that come into close contact with  scp-032 will find themselves unable to  use their respiratory or digestive  systems rendering them unable to breathe  oxygen or properly consume food not even  germs and other microorganisms are safe  from  scp-032's effects although when it comes  to these microscopic life forms her  ability seems to focus solely on their  reproductive systems and if bacteria  cannot divide itself it cannot spread at  present the scp foundation keeps  brother's bride housed in an automated  containment unit restricting the amount  of direct contact personnel can have  with her unless they are there to  conduct authorized experiments or other  necessary research related tasks staff  are to leave  scp-032 alone any interviews with her  are not even carried out in person and  instead researchers use a remote  communication array to ask scp-032 more  about her origin her creators and her  abilities this probably seems a little  over cautious right after all scp-032  has no effect on the human body and  isn't aggressive or outwardly hostile  maybe locking her in a room is excessive  but remember her degenerative abilities  do affect microorganisms and bacteria  even those that are beneficial to human  beings the human body is full of good  bacteria that aids with digestion and  helps the body absorb nutrients like the  ones you've heard about and ads for  probiotic yogurt since zero three two's  effects don't discriminate between good  and bad bacteria people have to keep  their distance from scp-032  or else they might find that they can no  longer digest food properly in fact no  biological material is allowed anywhere  near her no houseplants no pets nothing  oddly scp-032 herself seems fine with  this and has never expressed any desire  for any form of comfort and does not  appear to require sustenance like food  or water shortly after she was first  contained by the scp foundation  scp-032 was interviewed by dr alexander  kovac the resident psychologist at the  site where brothers bride was discovered  dr kovac initially tried to ask scp-032  to disclose her name however she was  unable to do so i don't have one people  have names i'm not one she then went on  to explain that even her creators had no  name for her and that she was instructed  to cooperate with the scp foundation dr  kovac pressed on asking about when she  told security that she was to be stored  until collected who scp-032 had meant  was coming to collect her her answer was  as enigmatic as could be expected she  claimed that she was going to be  collected by someone her creators wished  to torment and finding her in the hands  of the scp foundation would bring this  person greater suffering kovac asked if  this person was part of the foundation  assuming that scp-032's creators had  some kind of animosity towards a  particular member of personnel and that  0-3-2 was part of some kind of revenge  plot against a member of foundation's  staff  scp-032 denied this though stating he is  not one of you merely a one-time  sympathizer of sorts he believes you  tried to help him once and if he is  forced here if he finds me here you will  die that will hurt him they have no  interest in any of you or your  organization you are here as a tool just  as i am according to scp-032 the man  coming to collector was a prideful  complacent figure who won when he should  have lost somehow this individual had  apparently been punished by being forced  to live in exile from his kin and wander  the world endlessly destroying anything  in his path yet unwillingly his very  presence would poison human beings  leaving this man trapped in eternal  solitude tormented by the weight of his  guilty conscience  scp-032 described the man's punishment  as a masterwork of torment she described  her purpose in being sent to the  foundation as being to act as this man's  last undoing apparently this wanderer  would occasionally find solace in  looking at nature and find hope in the  world around him her ability to destroy  the organisms around her would be a way  to break this man's will and the final  nail in the proverbial coffin apparently  scp-032's appearance was also seemingly  meant to deceive him she stated that the  man would recognize her and this would  remind him of fond memories but then as  he got closer he would see scp-032 for  what she really was a crude replica of a  human being reminding this man that her  likeness would be forever out of his  reach  scp-032 was intended by her creators to  be as artificial as the wandering man's  hope and when he eventually found her  either in a day a month or in a century  she would destroy his very last source  of solace at the conclusion of the  interview dr kovac asked why this man  would recognize her and scp-032 simply  replied i used to be his wife if we take  scp-032 at her word then it appears she  was created with the intention of being  used to torment this wandering man and  act as a final punishment for him in  another interview six months after her  initial containment  scp-032 expressed a hatred for the man's  wife whom she was made to resemble sent  in to assess  scp-032's cognitive abilities and  personality or lack of dr kovac  questioned this  scp-032 had always been adamant that she  had no conscious thoughts or feelings of  her own and when challenged by the  doctor she claimed that she hated her  mold because her creators wanted her to  the first thing scp-032's creators had  done after making her was show her the  wife of the man they hoped to torment it  is unclear whether scp-032 was shown  photographs or the actual woman she had  been molded from not an easy task as  this woman the wife was apparently long  dead but the creators had risked  disturbing the wife's final rest just to  show her to scp-032  she was beautiful so peaceful serene  whole even gone even dead i could see  the essence of who she used to be of who  she still was and forever will be her  soul they told me she didn't get to live  for all that long but when she lived she  was herself she was alive and so i hated  her in the wife's face  scp-032 saw a reflection of herself and  realized that she had been made just to  be a mockery a parody of a living human  being existing only to cause misery to  the wandering man who would one day find  her instead of skin she had molded  silicone and plastic synthetic fiber in  place of hair and oil for blood but what  scp-032 lacked she realized was a soul  this was all part of the brother's  design according to scp-032  when the man found her he would see not  only what had been done to the memory of  his wife but he'd also see how much  scp-032  hated her and hated herself for not  being alive the same way the wife had  been the goal of all this to make the  man realize that he never won  scp-032 herself is a mystery but perhaps  the real question is who do you think  this man is and what was it he didn't  win but that's a story for another day  let us know what you think down in the  comments now go check out  scp-5545 mysterious tunnels in  antarctica abnormality and  scp-1730 what happened to site 13 the  full story compilation for more of the  most mysterious scps

